  "_comment": "Used by scripts/fetch-hub-news.mjs. Omit a group to keep manual news items for that slot. When an official vendor RSS is flaky (403/timeouts), some slots use TechCrunch topic feeds as a third-party headline source — not the vendor's own wording.",
